    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for the Localazy localization and translation management platform. Import and upload source content, export and download translated files, list files and their keys, read project languages, and manage projects. All endpoints are relative to https://api.localazy.com and authenticated with a Bearer token (project, translation, or organization token).\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Localazy Support\n Email: team@localazy.com",
